{"4926680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rebuilt: Last Settlement", "steam_appid": 4926680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/551070799f31328b55afde8d76899f49.webp?t=1784034128\" width=402 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use every hour wisely. Grow food, cook meals, craft ammo, build traps, repair defenses, and send survivor teams outside to scavenge for vital supplies. When night falls, fight back the zombie hordes and survive until morning.<strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1ee94958b5f9c453ac0868526ccb9ded.poster.avif?t=1784034128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1ee94958b5f9c453ac0868526ccb9ded.webm?t=1784034128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1ee94958b5f9c453ac0868526ccb9ded.mp4?t=1784034128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/02be654c3de4f71a6f64462c836c1b56.webp?t=1784034128\" width=402 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keep your survivors fed, healthy, and alive. Hunger, injuries, and death will lower morale, making your settlement weaker and slower the next day.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1cd88400adc8fb355fe76e332d7f3f9d.poster.avif?t=1784034128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1cd88400adc8fb355fe76e332d7f3f9d.webm?t=1784034128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1cd88400adc8fb355fe76e332d7f3f9d.mp4?t=1784034128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/7241cca565001fcd4a44b1da776edd15.webp?t=1784034128\" width=402 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Zombie hordes attack every night and grow stronger over time. Research new traps, unlock better weapons, upgrade your walls, and fight until dawn to protect your community.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/65eb4a4d0ef3da42c01f38d86fa5e06f.poster.avif?t=1784034128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/65eb4a4d0ef3da42c01f38d86fa5e06f.webm?t=1784034128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/65eb4a4d0ef3da42c01f38d86fa5e06f.mp4?t=1784034128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/ea698c8c6821b9d0f5e51f0bba07b321.webp?t=1784034128\" width=402 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start with a weak farmhouse and turn it into a fortified survivor base. Upgrade your walls, expand your defenses, research better tools, recruit more survivors, and prepare your community for the final escape from the city.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1ae71e6ebd3fdb1da8c7d4ed2a17b327.poster.avif?t=1784034128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1ae71e6ebd3fdb1da8c7d4ed2a17b327.webm?t=1784034128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1ae71e6ebd3fdb1da8c7d4ed2a17b327.mp4?t=1784034128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/551070799f31328b55afde8d76899f49.webp?t=1784034128\" width=402 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use every hour wisely. Grow food, cook meals, craft ammo, build traps, repair defenses, and send survivor teams outside to scavenge for vital supplies. When night falls, fight back the zombie hordes and survive until morning.<strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1ee94958b5f9c453ac0868526ccb9ded.poster.avif?t=1784034128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926680/extras/1ee94958b5f9c453ac0868526ccb9ded.webm?t=1784034128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src